# per-run telemetry and summaries are regenerable from seeds (see *.provenance.json); keep the repo small
analytics/runs/*
!analytics/runs/.gitkeep
# G-05: one truncated telemetry sample per (scene, condition) cell and the manifest of every run are committed
!analytics/runs/samples/
!analytics/runs/MANIFEST.csv
